# Columns whose values are sent to the model, by name in colheaders.txt.
#
# department is deliberately absent. It holds the administrative department
# or province -- Lima, Antioquia, Cundinamarca, Capital Federal -- and the
# model translates proper nouns:
#
#     Lima             -> Five             20,318,816 documents
#     Antioquia        -> Antioch           3,757,343 documents
#     Valle            -> Valais            (a Swiss canton)
#     Capital Federal  -> Federal Capital
#     Distrito Federal -> Federal District
#     Santiago         -> SANTIAGO
#
# "Lima" became the number five and was the largest department value in the
# index. Place names are the one thing in this corpus that must survive a
# translation unchanged, because every geographic question asked of the data
# is grouped by them. location is not in this list either, and its city names
# came through clean.
salary
title
duration
start
applications
jobtype
